KO welcomes us onto the common-list stage. Hołownia and Kosiniak-Kamysz refuse:
the very pressure meant to dissolve Third Way gives both leaders a reason to
defend it together. Inside Lewica, candidates ask whether democratic unity
always means standing beneath Tusk's name.

