We vote against, briefly, and then hand the day to the people the network has
been working with since March: three accounts read into the record with
consent, and an archive index of the cases the state has never examined.

The chamber has nothing to say to it. The resolution passes and is forgotten
inside a fortnight; the index does not go away, and the bishops' conference
spends the summer answering questions about specific files rather than about
national honour.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue

@mar23_res_free_vote
title: Release the caucus and let each deputy answer to their own constituency
subtitle: Protects the rural deputies and tells the country that the Left has no position on a question it spent March arguing about.
