Q.public_trust = (Number(Q.public_trust) || 0) + 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left supports the unilateral import ban";
!}

We back the closure and say the farmers were left carrying a war's economics
alone, which is true. In the eastern counties it lands, and the tractors stop
treating our people as intruders.

We have also endorsed a member state deciding for itself which Union rules
bind it — an argument we have spent two years opposing in every other file —
and we have added our name to the month in which Polish solidarity with Ukraine
began to be discussed as a cost.

- @apr23_missile

@apr23_missile
# prose-audit: Grade C — The missile, the four months in the woods and the civil-military blame exchange are staged with a locked review route; the forester who found it is described rather than heard.
title: The missile in the woods
subtitle: A Russian missile lay near Bydgoszcz for four months and nobody said so
face-image: img/poland/events/polish-f16.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.apr23_missile_done = 1;
Q.defence_readiness = Math.max(
    0, (Number(Q.defence_readiness) || 50) - 10
);
Q.civil_military_trust = Math.max(
    0, (Number(Q.civil_military_trust) || 50) - 12
);
Q.security_incident_pressure =
